Mr. Mayor.

762
00:48:33.789 --> 00:48:35.290
Mr. Knox.

763
00:48:36.583 --> 00:48:39.002
I see you've turned
off the power.

764
00:48:39.586 --> 00:48:42.130
Bring out Judge Meadows.
we'll turn it back on.

765
00:48:47.094 --> 00:48:49.220
She's not feeling well.

766
00:48:49.221 --> 00:48:53.892
but I believe I can get you in to see
her if you turn the lights back on.

767
00:49:11.618 --> 00:49:12.618
[power grid switches clicking]

768
00:49:12.619 --> 00:49:15.664
[citizens gasping]

769
00:49:39.271 --> 00:49:40.522
Just you two.

770
00:50:30.239 --> 00:50:32.782
- [gasps]
- [Shirley] What the fuck?

771
00:50:32.783 --> 00:50:35.202
[inhales sharply]
They set us up.

772
00:50:37.454 --> 00:50:41.415
- [Knox groaning]
- [Shirley grunts] No. No.

773
00:50:41.416 --> 00:50:45.586
- Listen to me. Knox. we need to go. Now.
- [breathing heavily]

774
00:50:45.587 --> 00:50:48.173
[breathes heavily]

775
00:50:48.966 --> 00:50:50.509
I'm not stopping you.

776
00:50:55.013 --> 00:50:56.431
You sure about this?

777
00:50:56.932 --> 00:50:58.725
I have raiders right outside.

778
00:50:59.393 --> 00:51:02.521
The people of the Silo have to
take care of this themselves.

779
00:51:03.564 --> 00:51:04.857
[panting]

780
00:51:05.899 --> 00:51:08.025
- We can't run.
- We have to run.

781
00:51:08.026 --> 00:51:11.279
There are 50 raiders and a
hundred angry assholes out there.

782
00:51:11.280 --> 00:51:13.489
We walk until we get
to Walker and McLain.

783
00:51:13.490 --> 00:51:15.742
- Then we run!
- Then we fucking run!

784
00:51:28.088 --> 00:51:29.173
[Knox] We have to leave.

785
00:51:30.132 --> 00:51:31.924
[Shirley whispers] Quick.
but don't look scared.

786
00:51:31.925 --> 00:51:34.219
[Carla] I wasn't.
until you said that.

787
00:51:37.848 --> 00:51:38.891
Okay.

788
00:51:42.311 --> 00:51:47.232
The push to impeach Judge
Meadows was unexpected.

789
00:51:48.108 --> 00:51:49.484
It forced my hand.

790
00:51:51.987 --> 00:51:53.447
Made this necessary.

791
00:51:55.908 --> 00:51:57.659
[sighs]

792
00:51:58.619 --> 00:51:59.744
[inhales sharply]

793
00:51:59.745 --> 00:52:02.873
I believe good will come of it.

794
00:52:05.083 --> 00:52:06.293
Still...

795
00:52:08.629 --> 00:52:10.255
I know you were behind it. Rob.

796
00:52:13.342 --> 00:52:15.344
Don't let 'em get too
much of a head start.

797
00:52:16.595 --> 00:52:18.013
You wouldn't want to lose them.

798
00:52:26.522 --> 00:52:29.565
[citizens murmuring]

799
00:52:29.566 --> 00:52:30.692
[Sims] Silence!

800
00:52:31.401 --> 00:52:32.402
[murmuring stops]

801
00:52:34.238 --> 00:52:35.656
I know some of you...

802
00:52:38.158 --> 00:52:39.326
many of you...

803
00:52:41.411 --> 00:52:45.499
didn't like Judge Meadows
meeting with some Down-Deepers.

804
00:52:48.418 --> 00:52:52.673
She only met with them
because. in her words.

805
00:52:53.799 --> 00:52:58.887
every citizen of the
Silo deserves a hearing.

806
00:53:02.349 --> 00:53:07.688
Well. it seems she
miscalculated horribly.

807
00:53:10.065 --> 00:53:13.068
Those animals from
Mechanical just killed her.

808
00:53:14.152 --> 00:53:15.528
[murmuring]

809
00:53:15.529 --> 00:53:17.364
They wanted to
open the air lock.

810
00:53:19.032 --> 00:53:21.118
And Judge Meadows refused.

811
00:53:22.244 --> 00:53:25.163
She gave her life for the Silo!

812
00:53:26.248 --> 00:53:27.249
For you!

813
00:53:28.125 --> 00:53:29.126
For me!

814
00:53:30.127 --> 00:53:34.715
It is now the duty
of every citizen

815
00:53:35.215 --> 00:53:40.094
to find those murderers
and bring them to justice!

816
00:53:40.095 --> 00:53:41.721
- Justice!
- [citizens murmuring]

817
00:53:41.722 --> 00:53:43.282
- [Sims] Justice!
- [citizens clamoring]

818
00:53:43.974 --> 00:53:45.349
Justice!

819
00:53:45.350 --> 00:53:47.186
- Justice!
- [clamoring continues]

820
00:53:48.854 --> 00:53:51.398
[crowd chanting] Justice!

820
00:53:52.305 --> 00:54:52.397
